sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant LS as LeadService
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
    participant CS as ClientService

    FE->>LS: POST /api/leads
    LS->>LS: leadRepository.save(lead)
    LS->>RMQ: Publish lead.client.resolve
    LS-->>FE: 201 Created (sem clientId — eventual)

    Note over RMQ,CS: ASSÍNCRONO
    RMQ->>CS: Deliver command
    CS->>CS: findOrCreate(cnpj, name, phone)
    CS->>RMQ: Publish client.resolved
    RMQ->>LS: Deliver event
    LS->>LS: lead.setClientId(clientId)
